           PASS: 440.0 Hz tone verified by Goertzel filter
  ok   B_880_full.wav           exit=1 want=1  verify-tone: target=440.0 Hz, detected=880.0 Hz, ... SNR=-9.0 dB
           FAIL: detected peak frequency 880.0 Hz differs from expected 440.0 Hz by 440.0 Hz (tolerance: 10.0 Hz)
  ok   C_220_full.wav           exit=1 want=1  verify-tone: target=440.0 Hz, detected=220.0 Hz, ... SNR=-1.8 dB
           FAIL: detected peak frequency 220.0 Hz differs from expected 440.0 Hz by 220.0 Hz (tolerance: 10.0 Hz)
  ok   D_445_full.wav           exit=0 want=0  verify-tone: target=440.0 Hz, detected=445.0 Hz, ... SNR=32.9 dB
           PASS: 440.0 Hz tone verified by Goertzel filter
  ok   E_silence.wav            exit=1 want=1  FAIL: audio signal is silence or near-zero (RMS = 0.0)
  ok   F_440_1328_samples.wav   exit=1 want=1  FAIL: audio too short: 1328 samples at 44100 Hz
  ok   G_440_unfinalized.wav    exit=0 want=0  verify-tone: target=440.0 Hz, detected=440.0 Hz, ... SNR=124.7 dB
           PASS: 440.0 Hz tone verified by Goertzel filter
  BATTERY_MISMATCHES= 0

  Case G exercises the direct-RIFF fallback for unfinalized WAVs (data chunk size
